B.SA=new A.aC("Adaptability","Powers up moves of the same type as the Pok\xe9mon (2x STAB instead of 1.5x).")
B.Tv=new A.aC("Aftermath","Damages the attacker for 1/4 max HP if knocked out by a contact move.")
B.Tb=new A.aC("Analytic","Boosts move power by 30% if the user attacks after the foe.")
B.SF=new A.aC("Anger Point","Maxes out Attack upon taking a critical hit.")
B.S8=new A.aC("Anticipation","Senses dangerous super-effective or one-hit KO moves on entry.")
