B.T2=new A.aC("Battle Armor","Hard armor protects the Pok\xe9mon from critical hits.")
B.Tr=new A.aC("Big Pecks","Protects the Pok\xe9mon from Defense-lowering effects.")
B.TC=new A.aC("Blaze","Powers up Fire-type moves by 50% when HP drops to 1/3 or below.")
B.Td=new A.aC("Chlorophyll","Doubles the Pok\xe9mon's Speed stat in harsh sunlight.")
B.Sq=new A.aC("Clear Body","Prevents other Pok\xe9mon's moves or Abilities from lowering stats.")
B.Sp=new A.aC("Cloud Nine","Eliminates all weather effects while the Pok\xe9mon is in battle.")
B.Sa=new A.aC("Compound Eyes","The Pok\xe9mon's compound eyes boost move accuracy by 30%.")
B.TE=new A.aC("Cute Charm","Making contact may cause the attacker to become infatuated/hesitate.")
B.S2=new A.aC("Damp","Prevents all Pok\xe9mon from using Self-Destruct or Explosion.")
B.TL=new A.aC("Defiant","Sharply raises Attack by 2 stages whenever a foe lowers its stats.")
B.Tj=new A.aC("Download","Raises Attack or Sp. Atk on entry based on the foe's lower Defense.")
B.To=new A.aC("Drought","Turns the sunlight harsh when the Pok\xe9mon enters battle.")
B.TB=new A.aC("Dry Skin","Restores HP from Water moves and Rain; takes extra damage from Fire and Sun.")
B.Sc=new A.aC("Early Bird","The Pok\xe9mon awakens twice as fast as other Pok\xe9mon from sleep.")
B.Ss=new A.aC("Effect Spore","Contact with the Pok\xe9mon may inflict poison, sleep, or paralysis.")
B.SZ=new A.aC("Filter","Reduces damage from super-effective attacks by 25%.")
B.TF=new A.aC("Flame Body","Contact with the Pok\xe9mon may burn the attacker.")
B.Tk=new A.aC("Flash Fire","Absorbs Fire-type hits to power up its own Fire moves by 50%.")
